XDB Wallet = Oracle Wallet used by Oracle XML DB Componenet.

Purpose:
- Store SSL/TLS certificates.
- Enable HTTPS for Oracle XML DB.
- Secure WebDAV and HTTP services.

at -> $ORACLE_BASE/admin/DBNAME/xdb_wallet
have files:
- ewallet.p12
- cwallet.sso

Useful commands:

SELECT dbms_xdb_config.gethttpport() FROM dual;
SELECT dbms_xdb_config.gethttpsport() FROM dual;
--if output 
5500 -> HTTPS
0    -> HTTP

****** in BANNER ESM ******

BANNER ESM
     │
     ▼
Connect using HTTPS/SSL
     │
     ▼
Oracle XDB
     │
     ▼
